⨯ keywords: `octet` is a keyword and may not be used as an identifier
  @ test.idl:3:10

 2 │ struct Data {
 3 │     long OCTET;
   │          ˆˆˆˆˆ this is an IDL keyword
 4 │     long Octet;
 5 │     long oCTET;

  ? the keyword can be escaped by changing to `_OCTET`
  * keywords are matched case-insensitively against identifiers

